    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6579cedf95e1550a02c164",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众的声音、令人颤抖的热度……\n不管睡着还是醒着，都会想到那天的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c71f4aede3392e5a8823eeb6e7e81e16b6d34ce3d01bc1204a1c257a5884e11",
