    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ec010d00ea68108edf5cfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年底的“有马纪念”赛后，\n玉藻十字向小栗帽宣战。\n从那之后，小栗帽的样子就不太对劲……",
      "source_fingerprint": "31673f6b2365c42e28f97bb2bc3bc98f7f1f4a47ca81687195956d23e6b763a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
