      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我并没有看轻小玉。\n我知道她是迟早要分出胜负的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3942a97f55d126e3e731e499cc7b0ad2a2087acad25322a9b45ed9c97159778f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
