      "uid": "zhcn:5c095d39dd3f2744d55aabe6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽在故乡留下了压倒性的成绩。\n正因为这样，她才对既是劲敌又是挚友\n的关系感到些许困惑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52264980abb4d17c1c188094a7f93b6df5de4af0b3668972cc1797ceaa3fd038",
