      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想起她们融洽相处的样子。\n她们一定没问题的。\n我如此相信，结束了新年参拜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bab03933a938dcf5cfb91a233e474ff6a0d7f909515fb947fa799ea41c1902c",
